{"id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-recursive-order-presentation.md","title":"df recursive order presentation","display":"df recursive order presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","aliases":["72-df-recursive-order-presentation"],"display":"df recursive order presentation","depends_on":["[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.3.4, print228–229/PDF240–241; explicit separation of formula and metatheoretic order","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-recursive-order-presentation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df recursive order presentation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.3.4, print228–229/PDF240–241; explicit separation of formula and metatheoretic order"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\langle d,r\\rangle\">\\(e=\\langle d,r\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,r\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\">\\(d,r\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\)</span>，元数分别为1、2，标准解释值域包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RO}\">\\(\\mathsf{RO}\\)</span> 是所有这样的程序对。语言固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a> 的PR扩展，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_e(x):=(f_d(x)=1)\">\\(D_e(x):=(f_d(x)=1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1)\">\\(x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1)\\)</span> 是对象公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\}\">\\(D_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{(m,n)\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\}\">\\(R_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{(m,n)\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LO}_e\">\\(\\operatorname{LO}_e\\)</span> 是对象公式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in D_e\\neg(x\\lhd_ex)\">\\(\\forall x\\in D_e\\neg(x\\lhd_ex)\\)</span>、传递性以及不同两元素恰一方向成立的合取；有界于D的量词展开为条件量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是指定语言的公式，默认归纳变量固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:=x_0\">\\(x:=x_0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是不与其他参数冲突的集变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)\\)</span> 在元理论中指严格线性序且每个非空子集有最小元。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}\">\\(\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 明确给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)\\)</span> 明示归纳变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>；辅助变量唯一取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}\">\\(y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}\\)</span>，默认 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prog}_e,\\operatorname{TI}_e\">\\(\\operatorname{Prog}_e,\\operatorname{TI}_e\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LO}_e\">\\(\\operatorname{LO}_e\\)</span> 中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\">\\(x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 取不被对象公式的其他参数占用的集变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RO}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^2:\\operatorname{ar}(d)=1\\land\\operatorname{ar}(r)=2\\land\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ d⟧)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ r⟧)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RO}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^2:\\operatorname{ar}(d)=1\\land\\operatorname{ar}(r)=2\\land\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ d⟧)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ r⟧)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_e(x)&amp;:=(f_d(x)=1),\\quad x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1),\\\\\nD_e^{\\mathbb N}&amp;:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\},\\\\\nR_e^{\\mathbb N}&amp;:=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\ne y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq D\\ (Y\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\ \\forall z\\in Y\\ (\\langle z,y\\rangle\\notin R)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_e(x)&amp;:=(f_d(x)=1),\\quad x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1),\\\\\nD_e^{\\mathbb N}&amp;:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\},\\\\\nR_e^{\\mathbb N}&amp;:=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\ne y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq D\\ (Y\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\ \\forall z\\in Y\\ (\\langle z,y\\rangle\\notin R)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)&amp;:=\\forall x\\,[D_e(x)\\to((\\forall y\\,(y\\lhd_ex\\to A[y/x]))\\to A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\,(D_e(x)\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_e(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_e(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)&amp;:=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(x_0\\in X),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_e&amp;:=\\operatorname{LO}_e\\land\\forall X_0\\operatorname{TI}_e(X_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRWO}&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\mathsf{RO}:\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\},\\\\\no(e)&amp;:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\quad(e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)&amp;:=\\forall x\\,[D_e(x)\\to((\\forall y\\,(y\\lhd_ex\\to A[y/x]))\\to A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\,(D_e(x)\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_e(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_e(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)&amp;:=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(x_0\\in X),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_e&amp;:=\\operatorname{LO}_e\\land\\forall X_0\\operatorname{TI}_e(X_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRWO}&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\mathsf{RO}:\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\},\\\\\no(e)&amp;:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\quad(e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LO}_e:=\\forall x(D_e(x)\\to\\neg(x\\lhd_ex))\\land\\forall x,y,z((x\\lhd_ey\\land y\\lhd_ez)\\to x\\lhd_ez)\\land\\forall x,y((D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land x\\ne y)\\to(x\\lhd_ey\\lor y\\lhd_ex)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LO}_e:=\\forall x(D_e(x)\\to\\neg(x\\lhd_ex))\\land\\forall x,y,z((x\\lhd_ey\\land y\\lhd_ez)\\to x\\lhd_ez)\\land\\forall x,y((D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land x\\ne y)\\to(x\\lhd_ey\\lor y\\lhd_ex)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Prog/TI/WO带e的是可写入理论的有限公式；PRWO与o(e)是元理论集合和序型函数。D允许递归子域，故也表示有限序数。用PR程序而非未经指定的“原始递归谓词”固定公式表示；同一语义关系的不同程序仍保留各自可证性。PRWO可用集合分离形成，但不声称可判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e=\\langle d,r\\rangle$，$d,r\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}$，元数分别为1、2，标准解释值域包含于 $\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathsf{RO}$ 是所有这样的程序对。语言固定为 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的PR扩展，$D_e(x):=(f_d(x)=1)$，$x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1)$ 是对象公式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e=\\langle d,r\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"d,r\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RO}","display":false},{"tex":"D_e(x):=(f_d(x)=1)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1)","display":false},{"tex":"D_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_e^{\\mathbb N}:=\\{(m,n)\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LO}_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in D_e\\neg(x\\lhd_ex)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x:=x_0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"y:=x_{\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prog}_e,\\operatorname{TI}_e","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LO}_e","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RO}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^2:\\operatorname{ar}(d)=1\\land\\operatorname{ar}(r)=2\\land\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ d⟧)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(⟦ r⟧)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_e(x)&:=(f_d(x)=1),\\quad x\\lhd_e y:=(D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land f_r(x,y)=1),\\\\\nD_e^{\\mathbb N}&:=\\{n\\in\\omega:⟦ d⟧(n)=1\\},\\\\\nR_e^{\\mathbb N}&:=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in(D_e^{\\mathbb N})^2:⟦ r⟧(m,n)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\ne y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq D\\ (Y\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\ \\forall z\\in Y\\ (\\langle z,y\\rangle\\notin R)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)&:=\\forall x\\,[D_e(x)\\to((\\forall y\\,(y\\lhd_ex\\to A[y/x]))\\to A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x}(A)&:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x}(A)\\to\\forall x\\,(D_e(x)\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prog}_e(A)&:=\\operatorname{Prog}_{e,x_0}(A),\\quad\\operatorname{TI}_e(A):=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)&:=\\operatorname{TI}_{e,x_0}(x_0\\in X),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WO}_e&:=\\operatorname{LO}_e\\land\\forall X_0\\operatorname{TI}_e(X_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRWO}&:=\\{e\\in\\mathsf{RO}:\\operatorname{WO}_{\\rm meta}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\},\\\\\no(e)&:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e^{\\mathbb N},R_e^{\\mathbb N})\\quad(e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LO}_e:=\\forall x(D_e(x)\\to\\neg(x\\lhd_ex))\\land\\forall x,y,z((x\\lhd_ey\\land y\\lhd_ez)\\to x\\lhd_ez)\\land\\forall x,y((D_e(x)\\land D_e(y)\\land x\\ne y)\\to(x\\lhd_ey\\lor y\\lhd_ex)).","display":true}],"bytes":4050,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation|df recursive order presentation]]"},{"id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathsf{RO}$、$D_e$、$\\lhd_e$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。$\\mathsf{P}_1$ 是元数1的PR程序集；$b,j,h,q\\in\\mathsf{P}_1$。对象变量 $x=x_0,p=x_1$ 互异；各显示全称量词为对象语言量词，$\\vdash_2^{(1)}$ 外的量化为元量化。"},{"id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathsf{RO}$，$e_\\varepsilon$ 为 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]] 的固定PR表示，$\\operatorname{TI}_e(A)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]，对数公式该构造也为数公式。"},{"id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$，$E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}$，并固定 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的有效有限演算。要求 $\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T$，其中 PR 函数符号及其定义方程取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。"},{"id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TI}^{\\mathrm{syn}}$ 的对象公式版本由 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]] 给出，必须同时指定关系代码与公式/集合参数。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-recursive-order-presentation|df recursive order presentation]]"},{"id":"76fae203d87d09fc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]] 的PR程序表示 $e_\\varepsilon$。对固定 $a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}$，$e_{<a}$ 取同一节点 Assertion 中的显式程序对，不按外延相等自行更换程序。$\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{<a}}(A)$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1a814f5220a079de","5e5fb64772853785","b63a805280ad1d8e"]}